SCREENS MSG-PENDING
HELP Enter open  x processed  X all processed  d discard  ? guide
KEY Enter Opens the message.
KEY x Marks it processed.
KEY X Marks every pending message processed (asks first, No by default).
KEY d Discards a message with format errors (errors list only).
KEY D Discards every message with format errors (asks first).
SEE MSG-INBOX MSG-VIEW
BEGIN_TEXT
Two lists. The top one is every message not yet acted on. The bottom one
is every message that came in with format errors, with what is wrong.

A message with errors is kept as it came. Open it to read it anyway: a
garbled line on a noisy band is often still readable. Ask for a repeat
when it matters.
END
